# Prisma
# DO NOT ignore migration SQL files. They MUST be committed so production
# deploys can run `prisma migrate deploy` deterministically.
# (Previous rule `prisma/migrations/**/migration.sql` was a bug that
#  silently dropped every migration across phases 1-4 + Knowledge P1.)

